---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
import Close from '../components/Close.astro';
import QuickAnswer from '../components/QuickAnswer.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { SHORT } from '../data/site.js';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Make the case', href: '/make-the-case' }];
const subject = 'Can we try Arcus free on one question?';
const email = `Subject: ${subject}

Hi,

I'd like Arcus to answer one question about our marketing with our own numbers. Trying it is free and there's no contract.

What they do: Arcus connects the data our teams keep in separate places (sales, customer data, ads, social, agency reports) into one place we own, inside our own setup, and adds what people say online. Each result is counted once, every number has a source, and every answer ends with what to keep, test and stop. They don't make ads, buy media or take a cut of spend.

What they need to try it: our question, access to the numbers it touches (sales, tickets or sign-ups, plus the ad accounts if it's about spend), and 30 minutes for a walkthrough.

Worst case, we confirm what's already working before the next budget.

How it works: https://usearcus.ai/how-it-works

Thanks`;
---
<Site title="Make the case for Arcus: a one-pager and email for your boss" description="Everything you need to get budget for marketing measurement: a one-page summary of Arcus, a copy-ready email to your boss, and answers for legal and finance." path="/make-the-case" page="case" crumbs={crumbs}>
  <header class="phero l">
    <Crumbs items={crumbs} />
    <h1 class="dh d96">Get the yes.</h1>
    <p class="lead">You’re sold. Your boss, finance and legal need a reason. Here’s everything to send them.</p>
    <div class="ph-obj case-obj" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="po-well">
        <div class="po-card back"><p class="logo" style="font-size:22px;min-height:0">arcus<i></i></p><p class="po-s">The one-pager, for finance</p><div class="po-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="po-card front"><span class="wl">Email</span><p class="po-t">{subject}</p><p class="po-s">To your boss · Ready to send</p><p class="po-s" style="color:var(--ink)">I’d like Arcus to answer one question about our marketing with our own numbers. Trying it is free and there’s no contract.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap blk-s">
    <QuickAnswer q="How do I pitch Arcus internally?" a="Start by trying it free: no cost, no contract, and it answers a question you’re unsure about with your own numbers and what people say. Send your boss the email below, print the one-pager for finance, and hand the Security page to legal." />
  </section>

  <section class="wrap blk" aria-labelledby="email-h">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="sec-h m0">
        <h2 id="email-h" class="dh d56">1. The email</h2>
        <p class="muted">Copy it, change what you like, send it.</p>
        <div class="btnrow l">
          <button type="button" class="jb k" data-copy="#case-email" data-jelly data-loc="case-copy"><span class="bg"></span><span class="lb">Copy the email</span></button>
          <a class="jb ln" href={`mailto:?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(email.split('\n').slice(2).join('\n'))}`} data-track="case_email_opened"><span class="bg"></span><span class="lb">Open in email</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="small" data-copied hidden role="status">Copied.</p>
      </div>
      <pre id="case-email" class="card" style="padding:24px;white-space:pre-wrap;font:15px/1.6 var(--text);margin:0">{email}</pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap blk" aria-labelledby="one-h">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2 id="one-h" class="dh d56">2. The one-pager</h2><button type="button" class="arrow" data-print style="background:none;border:0;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0">Print it <Arrow /></button><a class="arrow" href="/pdf/arcus-one-pager.pdf" download data-track="one_pager_downloaded">Download the PDF <Arrow /></a></div>
    <article class="card onepager" style="padding:40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px">
      <div class="stack-14">
        <p class="logo">arcus<i></i></p>
        <p class="h2s">{SHORT}</p>
        <p class="h3">What it answers</p>
        <ul class="dash"><li>Which spend paid off, counted once against our own numbers</li><li>What our audience says, and whether it lines up with what they buy</li><li>Which posts, creators and channels to keep, test or stop</li><li>Anything else we ask, with the whole picture behind it</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-14">
        <p class="h3">What it costs</p>
        <ul class="dash"><li>Trying it: $0</li><li>Setup (about three months) and monthly: quoted for our brand after we try it</li></ul>
        <p class="h3">What it takes</p>
        <ul class="dash"><li>One question, and access to the numbers it needs</li><li>30 minutes for a walkthrough</li></ul>
        <p class="h3">Risk</p>
        <ul class="dash"><li>No contract to try it</li><li>No change to our partners or tools</li></ul>
        <p class="small faint">usearcus.ai/free-report</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap blk" aria-labelledby="legal-h">
    <h2 id="legal-h" class="dh d56" style="margin-bottom:20px">3. For legal, finance and your boss</h2>
    <div class="tiles" style="--n:3">
      <a class="tile" href="/security"><span class="h3">Security</span><span class="muted small">What we access, who sees it, what the AI can do.</span><span class="arrow">Hand it to legal <Arrow /></span></a>
      <a class="tile" href="/pricing"><span class="h3">Pricing</span><span class="muted small">Three lines, itemized. The first one is free.</span><span class="arrow">For finance <Arrow /></span></a>
      <a class="tile" href="/reports"><span class="h3">Real answers</span><span class="muted small">What you’d get, with names removed.</span><span class="arrow">For your boss <Arrow /></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Close variant="navy" lines={['Or skip the', 'meeting.']} body="It costs nothing and needs no contract. You may not need anyone’s yes to start." loc="case-close" />
</Site>
